      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Urmiye</em>:\u00a0It is among the towns of <em>\u0100zerbayc\u0101n</em> (Azerbaijan). It is near <em>Bu\u1e25ayre-i Til\u0101</em> (Lake Urmia). <em>H\u00fcl\u0101g\u016b \u1e2a\u0101n</em> (Hulagu Khan) kept his treasury in that fortress and placed complete trust in its security. [translation]</p>",
